# tally 2.2.1 (#233, 233.c), L §8.4 (R-load, 2.1.7's R5): a check only the run can make speaks load's words: unit of
# a compound unit or a plain number, from a leg of unit kind currencies, is `a plain number or a compound unit is a key
# of no unit kind` (u2, u3); a key answers (u1). tally 2.2 said `a key of no unit kind`.
=== uq.tally
model uq
  tally 2
  on 2026-03-01
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31
source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01
unit EUR: currency minor 0.01
kind fx: event certain
  leg cash: currencies
place konto: accounts PLN lives 2026-01-01..
place world: outside lives 1900-01-01..
input bank: observed
version v
  cite s
  governs always
  known 2026-01-01
  opening[konto] = 0.00 PLN at 2026-01-01 start "s"
  bank[r1] = (on: 2026-01-10, kind: fx, leg cash from world to konto amount 5.00 PLN) "r1"
ask u1: unit(bank[r1].cash.amount)
ask u2: unit(bank[r1].cash.amount * bank[r1].cash.amount)
ask u3: unit(bank[r1].cash.amount / bank[r1].cash.amount)
=== expect
u1: PLN
  cut 2026-03-01
u2: refused: RUN-DOMAIN unit of 25 PLN^2: a plain number or a compound unit is a key of no unit kind
  cut 2026-03-01
u3: refused: RUN-DOMAIN unit of 1: a plain number or a compound unit is a key of no unit kind
  cut 2026-03-01
